# Kykar, Zephyr Awakener: the trigger is independent of its source once on the stack. In response to it Bot2's Swords to Plowshares
# exiles Kykar (Bot1 gains 3), and the trigger still resolves and exiles the Ornithopter, which returns at the beginning of the next
# end step: the delayed ability does not depend on Kykar being on the battlefield.

